"Type a domain of yours for the secure office address, e.g. example.com."
msgstr ""
"Escribe un dominio tuyo para la dirección segura de la oficina, p. ej. "
"example.com."

#. module: immich_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/immich_connector/models/setup.py:0
msgid "Type the Cloudflare token below first, or add the record by hand."
msgstr ""
"Primero escribe el token de Cloudflare de abajo, o agrega el registro a "
"mano."

#. module: immich_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/immich_connector/models/setup.py:0
msgid ""
"Type the Cloudflare token for the certificate first (Zone › DNS › Edit on "
"%s)."
msgstr ""
"Primero escribe el token de Cloudflare para el certificado (Zona › DNS › "
"Editar en %s)."

#. module: immich_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/immich_connector/models/setup.py:0
msgid ""
"Type the photo server's address on the office network, e.g. 192.168.1.20."
msgstr ""
"Escriba la dirección del servidor de fotos en la red de la oficina, p. ej. "
"192.168.1.20."

#. module: immich_connector
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:immich_connector.field_immich_setup_wizard__upload_port
msgid "Upload page port"
msgstr "Puerto de la página de subida"

#. module: immich_connector
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:immich_connector.res_config_settings_view_form_immich
msgid ""
"What is needed, the office addresses, the token and a zip with the photo "
"server's files, then a check that it calls in."
msgstr ""
"Lo que se necesita, las direcciones de la oficina, el token y un zip con los"
" archivos del servidor de fotos; luego se comprueba que se comunique."

#. module: immich_connector
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:immich_connector.selection__immich_setup_wizard__step__intro
msgid "What you need"
msgstr "Lo que necesita"

#. module: immich_connector
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:immich_connector.view_immich_setup_wizard
msgid ""
"Your guides' photos go to a photo server at the office; the website shows "
"them online. You need:"
msgstr ""
"Las fotos de sus guías van a un servidor de fotos en la oficina; el sitio "
"web las muestra en línea. Necesita:"

#. module: immich_connector
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:immich_connector.view_immich_setup_wizard
msgid "example.com"
msgstr "example.com"

#. module: immich_connector
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:immich_connector.res_config_settings_view_form_immich
msgid "http://192.168.1.50:2283"
msgstr "http://192.168.1.50:2283"

#. module: immich_connector
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:immich_connector.res_config_settings_view_form_immich
msgid "https://nas.example.com"
msgstr "https://nas.example.com"

#. module: immich_connector
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:immich_connector.view_immich_setup_wizard
msgid ""
"work: a DNS record that points it to the photo server, and a certificate."
msgstr ""
": un registro DNS que la apunta al servidor de fotos, y un certificado."

#. module: immich_connector
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:immich_connector.view_immich_setup_wizard
msgid ""
"› Create Token › \"Edit zone DNS\" template, Zone Resources: only this\n"
"                        domain. Paste it here: it goes only into the zip's <code>tls/tls.env</code> and leaves this\n"
"                        wizard on Finish."
msgstr ""
"› Crear token › plantilla \"Editar DNS de zona\", Recursos de zona: solo este\n"
"                        dominio. Pégalo aquí: va solo en el <code>tls/tls.env</code> del zip y sale de este\n"
"                        asistente al Finalizar."

#. module: immich_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/immich_connector/models/setup.py:0
msgid "✓ %(name)s → %(ip)s, the photo server."
msgstr "✓ %(name)s → %(ip)s, el servidor de fotos."

#. module: immich_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/immich_connector/models/setup.py:0
msgid "✓ Record corrected: %(name)s → %(ip)s (DNS only)."
msgstr "✓ Registro corregido: %(name)s → %(ip)s (solo DNS)."

#. module: immich_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/immich_connector/models/setup.py:0
msgid "✓ Record created: %(name)s → %(ip)s (DNS only)."
msgstr "✓ Registro creado: %(name)s → %(ip)s (solo DNS)."

#. module: immich_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/immich_connector/models/setup.py:0
msgid "✓ The record is already there: %(name)s → %(ip)s (DNS only)."
msgstr "✓ El registro ya existe: %(name)s → %(ip)s (solo DNS)."

#. module: immich_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/immich_connector/models/setup.py:0
msgid "✗ %(error)s Add the record by hand (below)."
msgstr "✗ %(error)s Agrega el registro a mano (abajo)."

#. module: immich_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/immich_connector/models/setup.py:0
msgid ""
"✗ %(name)s → %(found)s, not the photo server (%(ip)s). Correct the record."
msgstr ""
"✗ %(name)s → %(found)s, no es el servidor de fotos (%(ip)s). Corrige el "
"registro."

#. module: immich_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/immich_connector/models/setup.py:0
msgid "✗ %s is not found yet. A new record can take a few minutes; try again."
msgstr ""
"✗ %s todavía no se encuentra. Un registro nuevo puede tardar unos minutos; "
"vuelve a intentarlo."
